#: ../../source/docs/rover-steering-input-type-and-reversing-behaviour.rst:5
#: 26aae2e8ef904a98ba8907c8e86a334f
msgid "Steering Input Type and Reversing Behaviour"
msgstr "转向输入类型与倒车行为"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-steering-input-type-and-reversing-behaviour.rst:7
#: cef20ed1d17d4082a8d8065c11cdf033
msgid ""
"The :ref:`PILOT_STEER_TYPE <PILOT_STEER_TYPE>` parameter provides control of"
" two behaviours related to the pilot's steering input."
msgstr ":ref:`PILOT_STEER_TYPE <PILOT_STEER_TYPE>` 参数提供了与飞手转向输入相关的两种行为控制。"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-steering-input-type-and-reversing-behaviour.rst:10
#: 9e2fb3c298fe4c02981c03783f926a91
msgid "Two Paddle Input"
msgstr "双拨杆输入"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-steering-input-type-and-reversing-behaviour.rst:12
#: 623c1075102a46bcab738f45cf49d5ff
msgid ""
"Normally the user (aka Pilot) controls the vehicle using one transmitter "
"channel for steering (i.e. move a stick left-right) and another for throttle"
" (move a stick forward-back) but it is also possible to control the steering"
" and direction with two sticks (both moving forward-back) as if controlling "
"two wheels of a skid-steer vehicle (like R2D2)."
msgstr ""
"通常飞手（操控者）通过一个发射机通道控制转向（即摇杆左右拨动），另一个通道控制油门（摇杆前后推拉），但也可以用两根摇杆（均前后推拉）来控制转向和方向，就像控制差速转向车辆（如"
" R2D2）的两个车轮一样。"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-steering-input-type-and-reversing-behaviour.rst:14
#: 1ed2c1d94faf4b43a1dde24f8620433c
msgid ""
"This Two Paddle Input method can be enabled by setting "
":ref:`PILOT_STEER_TYPE <PILOT_STEER_TYPE>` to \"1\"."
msgstr "可通过将 :ref:`PILOT_STEER_TYPE <PILOT_STEER_TYPE>` 设为「1」来启用双拨杆输入方式。"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-steering-input-type-and-reversing-behaviour.rst:16
#: 335269b05cc84449b0021faafa223682
msgid ""
"Once enabled, raising RC input 1 channel high is like controlling the left "
"motor of a skid-steer vehicle so the vehicle will turn right.  Raising RC "
"input channel 3 is like controlling the right motor so the vehicle will turn"
" left.  Raising both channels high will cause the vehicle to move forward, "
"lowering both will cause the vehicle to backup."
msgstr ""
"启用后，将 RC 输入通道 1 推高相当于控制差速转向车辆的左电机，车辆将向右转。将 RC 输入通道 3 "
"推高相当于控制右电机，车辆将向左转。两个通道同时推高将使车辆前进，同时拉低将使车辆倒退。"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-steering-input-type-and-reversing-behaviour.rst:20
#: 7c6d8f60eea84284961560a5fb0a4eae
msgid ""
"Most users of skid steering vehicles should leave the :ref:`PILOT_STEER_TYPE"
" <PILOT_STEER_TYPE>` parameter at the default of \"0\" meaning the pilot "
"controls the vehicle using one RC input for throttle and another for "
"steering."
msgstr ""
"大多数差速转向车辆用户应将 :ref:`PILOT_STEER_TYPE <PILOT_STEER_TYPE>` 参数保持默认值「0」，即飞手通过一个 "
"RC 输入控制油门，另一个控制转向。"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-steering-input-type-and-reversing-behaviour.rst:23
#: 5f8a994add69431d917f5165d9e0b780
msgid "Reversing Behaviour"
msgstr "倒车行为"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-steering-input-type-and-reversing-behaviour.rst:25
#: 5326921565dd4ae6a99555a9a5d37fef
msgid ""
"ArduPilot Rover's reversing behaviour is just like a full sized car, "
"regardless of whether the vehicle is a regular steering-throttle style "
"vehicle or a skid-steering vehicles."
msgstr "ArduPilot Rover 的倒车行为与全尺寸汽车相同，无论是普通转向-油门式车辆还是差速转向车辆均如此。"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-steering-input-type-and-reversing-behaviour.rst:27
#: 3d5e3e43b45245328eb38c204d099561
msgid ""
"if moving forward with wheel turned right, vehicle turns in clockwise "
"direction"
msgstr "前进时向右转向，车辆顺时针转弯"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-steering-input-type-and-reversing-behaviour.rst:28
#: 32a54320e743449680651d3121fd2b00
msgid ""
"if moving backwards with wheel turned right, vehicles turns in counter-"
"clockwise direction"
msgstr "后退时向右转向，车辆逆时针转弯"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-steering-input-type-and-reversing-behaviour.rst:30
#: 1e8e7f0018a14872a0da02c345799737
msgid ""
"Some users, especially users of skid-steering vehicles and omni vehicles, "
"may wish the vehicle's turning direction to be the same whether moving "
"forward or reversing.  This can be accomplished by setting "
":ref:`PILOT_STEER_TYPE <PILOT_STEER_TYPE>` to \"3\""
msgstr ""
"部分用户，尤其是差速转向车辆和全向车辆的用户，可能希望车辆无论前进还是倒退转向方向保持一致。可通过将 :ref:`PILOT_STEER_TYPE "
"<PILOT_STEER_TYPE>` 设为「3」来实现"
